title: TVArtifacts
---
God: (placeholder) You found them. The stick. The hard bit. The glue.
God: (placeholder) They were one thing once. Put them back together.
<<cutscene Jigsaw>>
God: (placeholder) There. A hammer.
God: (placeholder) You have a round head. Mine has corners. Hold still.
<<cutscene Hammer>>
God: (placeholder) Much better. You are almost like me now.
God: (placeholder) If you want to be like me, you need to enter this.
<<cutscene Box>>
God: (placeholder) Head first.
<<cutscene IntoTheBox>>
