title: GreeterFirst
---
Greeter: Oh. Hello.
Greeter: That's a big round head you've got there.
Greeter: Is it... on purpose?
-> It's a television.
    Greeter: Televisions have corners. Yours doesn't have a single one.
    Greeter: I'm not judging. I'm just saying.
-> I don't know yet.
    Greeter: Fair. Most of us don't.
-> ...
    Greeter: Not a talker. That's all right.
Greeter: Anyway. Welcome to the field. There's a cave over there, if you like caves.
===

title: GreeterAgain
---
Greeter: Still round, I see.
-> Still round.
    Greeter: Good. Consistency matters.
-> Working on it.
    Greeter: Take your time.
===

title: GreeterLater
---
Greeter: I've said everything I know.
===
